{"id":"Wdd0f867abf1a6b995a93b633","zh":"土体静破坏强度","en":"","name":"土体静破坏强度","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wdd0f867abf1a6b995a93b633","text":"土体静破坏强度","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S34a7acc1d9be1b3676f8","source_id":"P132","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"本文采用LI 等 [19]提出的经验公式作为累积变形预测的数学模型,其表达式如下: εp = a(σd σs) m N b (2) 式中:εp 为累积应变率;σd 为路基的动偏应力;σs 为土体静破坏强度;N为荷载循环次数;a、b和m 为试验参数,与土体的类型和塑性指数有关,参数取值如表2所示 [20]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P132","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S8c3b5e1bf6b8cded639a","source_id":"P132","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"对于土体静破坏强度,采用下式计算: σs = 2qf = 2(ccu cosφcu 1 - sinφcu + 1 + K0 σcz sinφcu 1 - sinφcu) (4) 式中:qf 为土体不排水抗剪强度;ccu 为土体黏聚力;φcu 为土体内摩擦角;K0 为土体的侧限系数; σcz为土体的自重应力。","citations":[{"source_id":"P132","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P132":{"id":"P132","title":"车辆循环动载下高速铁路路基累积变形预测研究","authors":"李正,徐磊,王卫东,杜香刚,余志武,刘鹏飞,曾志平","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231073","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"李正等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-study-on-the-prediction-of-the-cumulative-deformation-of-high-speed-railway-subgrade-under-the-cycli"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"用于归一化动偏应力，反映荷载相对于土体强度的水平。","language":"zh","source_id":"P132","paper_slug":"2024-study-on-the-prediction-of-the-cumulative-deformation-of-high-speed-railway-subgrade-under-the-cycli","title":"车辆循环动载下高速铁路路基累积变形预测研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wf34e02103f97268571114cbc","name":"Static failure strength of soil","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wf34e02103f97268571114cbc","name":"Static failure strength of soil","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wf34e02103f97268571114cbc","name":"Static failure strength of soil","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P132","title":"车辆循环动载下高速铁路路基累积变形预测研究","authors":"李正,徐磊,王卫东,杜香刚,余志武,刘鹏飞,曾志平","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231073","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"李正等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-study-on-the-prediction-of-the-cumulative-deformation-of-high-speed-railway-subgrade-under-the-cycli"}]}